"1595765088161526", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_1595765091494859_4237715049970931987_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SP83a_0ef3IQ7kNvwFuPGxv&_nc_oc=Adprf8QtlDF7fecVfvJ2JnNs_CM-YVvYLMLAklenvjCttgq3EmjxlE0OphuaqyyQNXA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Qngxp4v7CS2XsN7pkM9x_SZhoilq7HRihU9VoWdEVBw&oe=6A3E82E3"}, {"file_name": "Be A Vacuum 1.png", "id": "945037191492650", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618277_945037194825983_9130630956925915969_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PJGw3au_lDMQ7kNvwGVIqAQ&_nc_oc=AdpiVd_r35cxorLCt2YVriSiUohqhODWhTv3xveCdwYayNza5qz9Tsn-m2B38MsG2co&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-7nwOtCXgKMBM4ZS_uuUE0knOp4ct_o_cbqR-Qtcsvdg&oe=6A3EAE97"}, {"file_name": "Be A Vacuum 4.png", "id": "1499920478249082", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_1499920481582415_3891370836892953395_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vevFEun5ZXYQ7kNvwEu8JlU&_nc_oc=Adq2v05qKqsUFHVizjb5KYyUolwZ2nat-ra_FjlKJf6EaM49tcBdLeTBXMz-gIg7Y4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_stbMDtBe8EAXjklmr0BTokkYMmeio6iEruvXXXvH_sQ&oe=6A3E8F47"}, {"file_name": "Be A Vacuum 7.png", "id": "796123406625144", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617719_796123409958477_6534286396876858588_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l86vwXg-GgMQ7kNvwHSYsku&_nc_oc=AdrjN4iboVVAsz2DUbW1Lzt9L9HTsvDd8Dh1xsCtzjKpjk4SWEX6Ef5tjjUobvhjhN0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_jLQikfeocdDaDyin2ha47wlMTRTUi0XpqpYMaobyJOw&oe=6A3E8DE5"}, {"file_name": "Be A Vacuum 5.png", "id": "25828612653480296", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831279_25828612656813629_8817952122205081524_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lE7e7bdnavoQ7kNvwGUP-r8&_nc_oc=Adr7p5npaztQGtOn91yf-QjErZGqzVrtfsYW1mkFpsuBw32A9jvwLprQm1uYGHWb5Yw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87Y41Md1Na1NeDN2VYO_brY4rpJ6lN1M-X7NUoy_YQ2A&oe=6A3EB024"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "491823802_1264056861811665_4923228075215390784_n.png", "id": "1269593875143006", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_1269593878476339_1498137638276603939_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yp8RmZUmckMQ7kNvwHjr-G_&_nc_oc=Adoood5hhMmciosrKAFSr6nceboYk1f-KxAsyVVOoAOo8Hs3PMKIFzly26r3oHGA5H8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_bwCp6spHKlTFB-KcdOIF0JQI00prlpv170CdeAXVLOg&oe=6A3E7A1C"}, "display_name": "Be A Vacuum - Sandbox Simulator", "keywords": ["Cleaner", "Simulator", "room", "job"], "long_description": "# Get Ready for a Chaotic Cleaning Adventure Like No Other in Be a Vacuum!\n\n**Messy Rooms, Clean Fun**\n\nControl your vacuum in a colorful, cartoon-styled home and suck up everything in your path! Explore rooms, clean up messes, and watch your vacuum\u2019s power grow.\n\n{3862473080550901}\n\n**Suck It Up, Toss It Around!**\n\nCollect everyday objects like fruits and toys with your vacuum, then launch them as projectiles! Aim at walls and windows to create chaos and have fun in your vibrant home environment.\n\n{2137796553639870}\n\n**Toss Granny Into Chaos!!**\n\nEngage in hilarious, physics-based mayhem as you use everyday items to toss and disrupt the environment! Watch as Granny  tumble and furniture flies in this slapstick-filled VR adventure.\n\n{1702644414430298}\n\n**Clean & Chaos!**\n\nGrab fruits, toys, and eggs with your vacuum, then launch them across the room! Watch as everything tumbles and creates hilarious, unpredictable chaos in the living room.\n\n{1282306184010519}", "short_description": "Get ready for chaotic cleaning fun in Be a Vacuum! Control a vacuum cleaner in a vibrant, cartoon-styled home as you suck up everything from toys to fruits and even NPCs. Launch objects across the room with hilarious physics-based gameplay, turning everyday cleaning into a wild adventure. Tidy up the living room, kitchen, and bedroom while causing messy mayhem with your vacuum. With interactive environments and slapstick humor, this VR experience will keep you laughing and cleaning non-stop!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "805270042341811", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Be A Vacuum - Sandbox Simulator", "keywords": ["Job", "Simulator", "Cleaner"], "long_description": "# Get Ready for a Chaotic Cleaning Adventure Like No Other in Be a Vacuum!\n\n**Messy Rooms, Clean Fun**\n\nControl your vacuum in a colorful, cartoon-styled home and suck up everything in your path! Explore rooms, clean up messes, and watch your vacuum\u2019s power grow.\n\n{1375042294465856}\n\n**Suck It Up, Toss It Around!**\n\nCollect everyday objects like fruits and toys with your vacuum, then launch them as projectiles! Aim at walls and windows to create chaos and have fun in your vibrant home environment.\n\n{987826313757482}\n\n**Toss Granny Into Chaos!!**\n\nEngage in hilarious, physics-based mayhem as you use everyday items to toss and disrupt the environment! Watch as Granny  tumble and furniture flies in this slapstick-filled VR adventure.\n\n{1300612658308974}\n\n**Clean & Chaos!**\n\nGrab fruits, toys, and eggs with your vacuum, then launch them across the room! Watch as everything tumbles and creates hilarious, unpredictable chaos in the living room.\n\n{1318999270111570}", "short_description": "Get ready for chaotic cleaning fun in Be a Vacuum! Control a vacuum cleaner in a vibrant, cartoon-styled home as you suck up everything from toys to fruits and even NPCs. Launch objects across the room with hilarious physics-based gameplay, turning everyday cleaning into a wild adventure. Tidy up the living room, kitchen, and bedroom while causing messy mayhem with your vacuum. With interactive environments and slapstick humor, this VR experience will keep you laughing and cleaning non-stop!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tretastudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27355625477371461"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_911770275007388_6760251552588868410_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rs5Q4qjSjzIQ7kNvwG3MOdB&_nc_oc=Adq-vNsm-3ijgjWNlGxoZClpkpgJ-jPU1gHMTsAEu773CsLJgzgzaAZ8QkcW2YScBBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-aV_rYnaibHfleQfBUxyA3xl4ZN6tEpGJ4OTeCPHKJwQ&oe=6A3E9639"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Be A Vacuum - Sandbox Simulator", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Sandbox", "id": "1990104051447093"}, {"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}], "release_date": 1777001880, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "26772306755703339", "relea